window.NEWS_DATA.en = {"three":[{"t":"The EU will limit imports of hybrid cars, including ones made in Japan","x":"On the 24th, the EU decided to limit imports of hybrid cars, which have suddenly increased, for up to 200 days from December 1, with a cap on the number of cars from each country. The main target is cars made in China, but Japanese cars such as Toyota's are also included (NHK, Response, Nikkei Asia). This is connected to Japan's car exports and to the lives of people who work at car companies."},{"t":"The opposition will submit a censure motion against Education Minister Seki tomorrow, the 26th","x":"The opposition in the House of Councillors plans to submit a censure motion against Education Minister Seki at 10 a.m. tomorrow, the 26th (Kyodo, TBS, ANN). Furukawa, acting leader of the Democratic Party for the People, told him to \"resign on his own,\" and the ruling parties are getting ready for a vote (NHK). The opposition warns that it will not discuss the bill to cut the consumption tax unless he resigns (TBS, Jiji). This affects whether the 1% consumption tax on food starts in April next year. Before this: on the 24th, the special committee of the House of Councillors held a central public hearing. The prime minister defended Seki, saying he \"is meeting his responsibility to explain\" (Kyodo, Jiji, ANN)."},{"t":"Personal information of about 10.63 million people may have leaked from Keio Corporation","x":"Because of an attack by a virus that asks for ransom, information about customers and workers of 47 group companies may have leaked, including about 1.6 million passport copies and Keio Department Store card numbers (Keio's announcement, NHK, TBS). If you have used their services, check messages from the company and your card statements."}],"top10":[{"t":"The Nikkei average closes 1,633 yen lower at 57,011 yen as U.S. AI stocks drop again","x":"On the 25th, the Nikkei average fell sharply on the Tokyo stock market and closed 1,633 yen lower at 57,011 yen (Kyodo, Kabutan). In the morning it was down more than 2,100 yen at one point (ANN, Kabutan, NHK). People worried about the future of AI businesses, and stocks of chip companies were sold (Kyodo). In New York the day before, the Dow rose 423 dollars (Kyodo), but the Nasdaq fell, and Nvidia, which had risen about 30% the day before, dropped 6%. The stock of Anthropic, which was listed on the 19th, fell below its offering price (Minkabu, Yahoo Finance, Investing.com).","w":[["close","(株価が)終わる"],["offering price","公開価格"]]},{"t":"Is your information included? Personal information of about 10.63 million people may have leaked from Keio Corporation","x":"On the 24th, Keio Corporation announced that because of an attack by a virus that asks for ransom (ransomware), information about about 10.63 million people, such as customers and workers of 47 group companies, may have leaked. This includes about 1.6 million passport copies and about 20,000 Keio Department Store card numbers. An overseas hacker group called \"Qilin\" says it did the attack (Keio's announcement, Business+IT, TechnoEdge). NHK and TBS reported \"more than 11 million people.\" Before this: the Keio group had already had problems with some business systems because of ransomware (train services were not affected).","w":[["ransom","身代金"],["leak","漏れる"]]},{"t":"The opposition will submit a censure motion against Education Minister Seki on the 26th; it also affects the tax cut bill","x":"On the 24th, the opposition in the House of Councillors decided to submit a censure motion against Education Minister Seki. They warned that they cannot discuss the bill to cut the consumption tax on food unless Seki resigns or is replaced (TBS, Jiji). Seki says he will not resign, and Prime Minister Takaichi also defends him, saying he \"is fully meeting his responsibility to explain\" (Kyodo, Jiji, ANN). On the 25th, the opposition decided to submit the motion at 10 a.m. on the 26th (Kyodo, TBS, ANN). Furukawa, acting leader of the Democratic Party for the People, told him to \"resign on his own,\" and the ruling parties are getting ready for a vote (NHK). Chief Cabinet Secretary Kihara said that officials from ministries sometimes explain things at party events, for both ruling and opposition parties (NHK, Kyodo).","w":[["censure motion","問責決議案"],["resign","辞任する"]]},{"t":"Hanshin's Teruaki Sato agrees to a six-year contract worth about 19.1 billion yen with the Cubs, U.S. media report","x":"U.S. media reported that Hanshin's Teruaki Sato agreed to a contract with the Chicago Cubs for six years and about 19.1 billion yen. It is the biggest contract ever for a Japanese fielder (NHK, Nikkei, Hochi, Daily Sports).","w":[["contract","契約"],["agree","合意する"]]},{"t":"The EU will limit hybrid car imports for up to 200 days from December 1, including Japanese cars","x":"The EU will limit imports of hybrid cars for up to 200 days from December 1. The main target is cars made in China, but Japanese cars such as Toyota's are also included. This may affect Japan's car exports (NHK, Response, Nikkei Asia).","w":[["import","輸入"],["export","輸出"]]},{"t":"The Houthis attack the tallest building in Riyadh, the capital of Saudi Arabia; 11 people are injured","x":"The Houthis attacked the tallest building in Riyadh, the capital of Saudi Arabia, and 11 people were injured. This is also connected to the future of oil prices (NHK, BusinessWorld, India TV).","w":[["attack","攻撃"],["injured","けがをした"]]},{"t":"China launches Shenzhou-24, and it docks with the Tiangong space station","x":"China launched Shenzhou-24, and on the same day it docked with the Tiangong space station. Pakistan's first astronaut will stay there as the first foreigner (Dawn, ThePrint, AP, The Japan Times).","w":[["dock","ドッキングする"],["astronaut","宇宙飛行士"]]},{"t":"Customer information of about 2 million people leaks from Pal System, a co-op delivery service","x":"Customer information of about 2 million (1,997,972) cases leaked from Pal System, a co-op home delivery service. The cause was unauthorized access to KARTE, a service run by another company, and more companies are still announcing leaks from the same cause (NHK, Pal System's announcement).","w":[["leak","漏れる"],["customer","顧客"]]},{"t":"In Kitashiobara, Fukushima, where heavy snow hit, about 100 Ground Self-Defense Force members start removing fallen trees and clearing snow today","x":"In Kitashiobara Village, Fukushima Prefecture, where heavy snow damage continues, about 100 members of the Ground Self-Defense Force start removing fallen trees and clearing snow today, to bring power back quickly (Fukushima Minpo, Fukushima Minyu, Kyodo).","w":[["fallen tree","倒れた木"],["clear snow","除雪する"]]},{"t":"NHK's 2029 historical drama will be \"Mitsunari no Uta,\" starring Ryunosuke Kamiki","x":"NHK's 2029 historical drama (taiga drama) will be \"Mitsunari no Uta,\" and Ryunosuke Kamiki will play the lead role. It is the first time Ishida Mitsunari will be the main character of a taiga drama. The script will be written by Tsutomu Kuroiwa (NHK, Hochi, Cinema Today).","w":[["lead role","主役"],["script","脚本"]]}],"ex":{"saudi":"In the Middle East, an armed group and Saudi Arabia keep fighting, and oil prices are rising. This connects to gas prices in Japan.","tax":"A plan to lower the tax on food you buy at the supermarket from 8% to 1%. It passed the House of Representatives, and the House of Councillors is now discussing it. It is not decided yet.","cyber":"Bad actors keep breaking into the computers of companies and government offices and stealing information such as names and addresses. On November 6, the government made an emergency package and will spend about 10 billion yen.","mmx":"A Japanese probe has left for Mars. The plan is to bring back sand from a small moon near Mars.","sato":"Sato, this year's \"Triple Crown\" hitter, reportedly agreed to a contract with the Chicago Cubs for six years and about 19.1 billion yen (11/25).","series":"SoftBank beat DeNA 4 games in a row and became Japan's champion for the second year in a row (10/28).","yokohama":"There was an election to choose the leader (mayor) of Yokohama, and a new person was chosen.","past":"Three weeks of worries about a big typhoon and a volcano, a new governor of Okinawa and new ministers, and higher interest rates in America.","ukr":"Talks to end the war between Russia and Ukraine were held in Abu Dhabi on November 10 and 11. A large prisoner exchange was reportedly agreed, but there was no big progress such as a ceasefire. In late November, Russia's big attacks continued and missiles even fell in Poland, a NATO member, so NATO will hold emergency talks on the 23rd (Poland will propose stronger air defense).","typhoon":"Typhoon No. 30 changed into an extratropical low on the night of the 25th. On the 26th, heavy rain is possible from Kyushu to Kanto.","shogi":"Shogi player Tomoka Nishiyama decided to become a \"kishi,\" the professional player status open to both men and women. In April next year she will be the first woman kishi in shogi history.","reporter":"A Japanese newspaper reporter was arrested in Russia as a \"spy.\" The Japanese government says he is not a spy and asks Russia to send him home soon.","hamaoka":"Local residents went to court asking to stop the Hamaoka nuclear plant in Shizuoka, but the court dismissed the case. On November 5, the residents appealed.","israel":"There was a parliament election in Israel, and the prime minister's side may not win more than half of the seats.","teisu":"Political parties are talking about whether to reduce the number of members of the House of Representatives.","fed":"The Fed, America's central bank, kept interest rates the same in October, but more and more voices say it will likely raise them in December.","cold":"From November 18, strong cold air suddenly brought winter. On the 20th, 24 cm of snow fell in one night in Asahikawa, and Sendai had its first snow. During the three-day weekend, be careful of snow on roads in northern Japan and Hokuriku.","typhoon31":"A strong typhoon will come closest to the Ogasawara Islands, south of Tokyo, around the morning of the 5th. It will not reach the main islands, but Kanto should watch out for heavy rain.","midterm":"In America, there was an election for members of Congress. The opposition Democrats will have more seats in both the House and the Senate. It will be harder for the president's policies to pass, and it affected the yen and stocks.","tokai":"A strong earthquake hit the Tokai area in the middle of the night on November 8. Aichi Prefecture had shindo 5+ for the first time in about 30 years, and some people were injured.","fukuoka":"In the election for the mayor of Fukuoka, so many people ran that the votes were split and no one could win. The election will be held again."}};
